{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Blocked on external Gerrit availability after patch set 2 CI success. Evidence: GitHub run 33562114198 completed success at 2026-09-01T22:08:18Z; Gerrit change 2480 had `Verified +1` visible before the outage, but `LLM-Review` was still 0. Posted documented `rerun-llm-review` comment. Since then, bounded probes from this host show Gerrit HTTPS timing out (`curl --connect-timeout 10 --max-time 30 https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/` -> SSL connection timeout / HTTP 000) and SSH command port timing out (`ssh -o ConnectTimeout=20 -p 29418 ... gerrit version` -> timed out during banner exchange). GitHub/origin connectivity remains healthy. Cannot safely read final labels, submit, or close until Gerrit is reachable; no force used and no further pushes are pending."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788302918939456001,"uuid":"829ed9fe-e3c7-4b6a-b364-6442e685fd55"}